# Pedagogo Desk – Default Gemini API Key
# Copy this file to .env and replace the placeholder with your actual key.
# Get one free at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# SPRINT A.5 — PRE-PROVISIONED BUILD (for her / pilot users):
#   1. cp .env.example .env  →  paste YOUR key below  →  npm run build
#   2. Host dist/ (Netlify/Vercel/static) or send her the folder.
#   3. She opens the link → badge reads "AI Ready ✓" → she never sees the
#      word "API". The key CTA is hidden in Zero-setup mode while a project
#      default (or any) key is active.
#   Quota math: 1 heavy student ≈ 10–30 requests/day — safely inside the
#   free tier (15 req/min • 1,500 req/day). One shared key ≈ 10 pilot users.
#   WARNING: the key ships inside the JS bundle (extractable). Fine for 1
#   trusted user; for strangers use invite links (?key=) + daily caps instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
